
### Create a new task
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete DevTrack API testing",
  "completed": false
}


### Get a task by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/10


### Update an existing task
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/10
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "DevTrack API testing completed",
  "completed": true
}


### Delete a task
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/10


### Validation test: empty task title
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "completed": false
}


### Validation test: title too short
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "AB",
  "completed": false
}


### Error handling test: nonexistent task
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/999999



